# The units that DN takes from Borland Turbo Vision (replaced by tv/, PLAN.md decisions 6 and 11) and what
# gives their names: `UnitName: TvUnit TvUnit...` (tools/gen-shim.py, called by tools/dn-materialize.sh).
# What DN adds to TV, and the names that differ, are in dn/new/manual/UNIT.inc (interface) and
# UNIT.impl.inc (implementation).
Defines:  TvGeom TvObjs TvUtil TvEvents TvKeys TvViews TvWindow TvDialog TvMsgBox TvCluster TvList TvInput +VPSysLow
_Defines: TvGeom TvObjs TvUtil TvEvents TvKeys TvViews TvWindow TvDialog TvMsgBox TvCluster TvList TvInput +VPSysLow
Views:    TvGeom TvColors TvCell TvKeys TvEvents TvDrawBuf TvText TvUtil TvObjs TvViews TvWindow
_Views:   TvGeom TvColors TvCell TvKeys TvEvents TvDrawBuf TvText TvUtil TvObjs TvViews TvWindow
Dialogs:  TvDialog TvInput TvCluster TvList TvHist TvValid
_Dialogs: TvDialog TvInput TvCluster TvList TvHist TvValid
Collect:  TvObjs
_Collect: TvObjs
Streams:  TvObjs
_Streams: TvObjs
Scroller: TvWindow
Validate: TvValid
ColorSel: TvColorSel
HistList: TvHist
MsgBox:   TvMsgBox
App:      TvApp
_Apps:    TvApp
Menus:    TvMenus
StdDlg:   TvFileDlg TvChDir TvFiles
